      "en": "So I bought her for myself for fifteen pieces of silver and a homer and a half of barley.",
      "ko": "내가 은 열 다섯개와 보리 한 호멜 반으로 나를 위하여 저를 사고",
      "source_text_hash": "f6a40af93ac3efc9511625cc50c11079abda81e9afe12a4873084213b77dd561",
      "translation_text_hash": "ea76f1856979f1cbe9b19d6dd1fc7467f366f1c94a7b2e2019c04b51c3dd7c16",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
